            "review_title": "Review at Nhà hàng Nam Phương Lầu",
            "review_text": "Nguyen T\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam3 contributions\n0\nDelightful Fusion of Vietnamese and Chinese Cuisine\nMay 2025 • Friends\nI and my friends (group of 8) had an amazing experience at Nam Phuong Lau restaurant. The menu features a fantastic blend of Vietnamese and Chinese dishes. The seafood was also incredibly fresh and expertly prepared\n\nThe Sashimi Platter and the Hot Pot (i forget the name) were the highlight, showcasing the freshness of the seafood paired beautifully with aromatic spices. Each bite was a perfect harmony of flavors\n\nThe ambiance was warm and inviting, making it a wonderful place to enjoy a meal. Highly recommend for those who love innovative fusion cuisine\nRead more\nWritten May 22, 2025",
